{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 9, :comments ["<b>For it is a festival of YHWH</b> — Four times in the Masorah: חג ה' לנו · באספכם וגו' תחגו את חג ה' · הנה חג ה' בשילו · מה תעשו ליום מועד וליום חג ה'. For they said to him, 'For it is a festival of YHWH for us,' and we need to gather everything we have — the produce of the land and the women — to dance in dances, and nothing shall remain; everything you must send. And if you do not send, you will see what you will do for the day of the festival of YHWH."], :book :exodus, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 10, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:12:23.019109107Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}